<title>JAPAN: Keifuku - 96/97 group results.</title>
<headline>Keifuku - 96/97 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 24.54		vs	   26.64</p>
<p> Operating     loss 5    million	  vs    loss 66    million</p>
<p> Current     loss 399    million	  vs   loss 565    million</p>
<p> Net	    loss 25    million	  vs    loss 54    million</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 1.27 yen	  vs     loss 2.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Keifuku Electric Railroad Co Ltd is a local railway operator.</p>
